{"version":1,"content":"<p>深秋時節，神州大地層林盡染、沃野流金，一幅幅色彩斑斕的金秋畫卷自北向南展開。</p><p>秋日山野景致就如唐代詩人王績在《野望》中描繪：「樹樹皆秋色，山山唯落暉。</p><p>」（新華社）</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:50.139075+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":82,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T06:55:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T07:38:23.466678+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:41:26.771725+00:00","content_hash":"8b1f1d94e5d74dd93922ecc6b359f11735202f6a74e41956a64cf5fc9d150b0d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}